  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Originally from the shoreline of Connecticut, USA, summer and the desire to be at the beach runs deep in Spencer's DNA.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">He spent almost all of his twenties working, studying, and developing a life abroad as a global citizen. This has shaped and influenced him in many ways.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">The Azure was sparked in Thailand, refined and groomed in The Mediterranean, and brought to life in Los Angeles. These three phases of his time around the sun are found within the environment in which The Azure is aiming to create.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">He wants people to indulge in a life more elevated by delivering premium products that enhance the everyday.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Live slowly, look good, and take comfort in the escape.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Our products are wonderfully made, reasonably priced. We elevate your experience when laying horizontally at the beach, in the park, or wherever you may find yourself. Handmade, premium head hammocks that do the heavy lifting!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>",
